# Generated by `npm test`, rewritten on every run, and therefore a guaranteed merge conflict
# between any two branches that both run the tests (Wyatt, 2026-09-08). It was tracked until
# then, and it collided constantly: two sessions, two worktrees, two timestamps, same file.
# The report is evidence for the person who ran it, not a fact about the repo. Officers should
# read the local file — it is still written to the same path — and say when it was produced,
# rather than treating a committed copy as proof that a given commit was tested.
.claude/TEST-REPORT.md
